# Both use `AILogic$ Fog` (EffectAi.java:112 -> FogAi). Harsh Justice (same logic, needs ActivationPhases Declare Attackers
# + CheckSVar) is deliberately NOT in this patch: it was never cast even with the flag removed (see EXPERIMENTS.md 003).
# Test (AiLabSim, equal life 20/20, 10 games each, 150 s cap): Adeline mono-white 40-card deck, 2 copies of each test card,
# vs a mono-red 40-card deck.
#   baseline (flag present): casts 0
#   patched (flag removed):  Endure 15 casts, Shield Dancer 11 casts + 19 activations; wins A=4 B=6 vs baseline A=6 B=4,
